# Copy to .env.local for local development, or set these in
# Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# None of these are required. With no key the engine runs exactly as it does
# offline: the deterministic theme is a complete product, and the refinement
# pass simply never fires.
#
# NEVER prefix any of these with NEXT_PUBLIC_. That prefix inlines the value
# into the client bundle at build time, making it readable by every visitor —
# and once a key has shipped that way, rotating it is the only remedy.

# Server-side only. Read in app/api/read/route.ts.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to deepseek-v4-pro.
# DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-v4-pro

# Optional. Defaults to https://api.deepseek.com — override for a proxy or a
# self-hosted OpenAI-compatible endpoint.
# DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
